5	2026-10-22 04:37:04.768555+00	t	0		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 60px 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 15px;">\r\n        Welcome to Data Sphere Global\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: normal;">\r\n        Your Journey Starts Here\r\n    </h2>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 30px auto;">\r\n        We are delighted to welcome you to <strong>Data Sphere Global (DSG)</strong>.\r\n        As a new member of our team, you are joining a workplace built around\r\n        collaboration, innovation, professionalism, and continuous growth.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 750px; margin: auto;">\r\n        This onboarding journey will introduce you to our company, workplace\r\n        culture, important policies, employee responsibilities, professional\r\n        standards, and the expectations that come with being part of DSG.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 20px; margin-top: 40px;">\r\n        <strong>Welcome aboard!</strong>\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
6	2026-10-22 08:38:42.848739+00	t	1		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        About Data Sphere Global\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Data Sphere Global is a technology-driven organization focused on\r\n        delivering innovative digital solutions, reliable services, and\r\n        meaningful business outcomes for our clients and partners.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Our work depends on talented people working together across different\r\n        teams, departments, technologies, and areas of expertise.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2 style="margin-top: 30px;">What We Believe In</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Innovation and continuous improvement</li>\r\n        <li>Professionalism and accountability</li>\r\n        <li>Collaboration and teamwork</li>\r\n        <li>Customer-focused thinking</li>\r\n        <li>Integrity and transparency</li>\r\n        <li>Learning and personal development</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <p style="margin-top: 25px; padding: 20px; background: #f4f7fa; border-radius: 10px;">\r\n        <strong>Our people are our strength.</strong>\r\n        Every employee contributes to the culture, reputation, and success of DSG.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
7	2026-10-22 08:38:42.856665+00	t	2		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Your First Days at DSG\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;">\r\n        Starting a new job can be exciting and challenging. Our goal is to make\r\n        your transition into DSG as smooth as possible.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>During Your Initial Onboarding</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ol style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2.1;">\r\n        <li>Complete the required joining and HR documentation.</li>\r\n        <li>Become familiar with your department and reporting structure.</li>\r\n        <li>Meet your manager, team members, and relevant colleagues.</li>\r\n        <li>Understand your role and key responsibilities.</li>\r\n        <li>Receive access to the systems and tools required for your work.</li>\r\n        <li>Review applicable company policies.</li>\r\n        <li>Understand workplace communication and reporting procedures.</li>\r\n        <li>Ask questions whenever something is unclear.</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n\r\n    <p style="padding: 20px; background: #f4f7fa; border-radius: 10px;">\r\n        <strong>Remember:</strong> You are not expected to know everything on\r\n        your first day. Learning your role and understanding the organization\r\n        takes time.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
8	2026-10-22 08:38:42.859791+00	t	3		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Our Core Values\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 17px;">\r\n        Our values guide the way we work, communicate, make decisions, and\r\n        represent Data Sphere Global.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <div style="margin-top: 30px;">\r\n\r\n        <h2>1. Integrity</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Be honest, transparent, and trustworthy. Take responsibility for\r\n            your actions and communicate information accurately.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>2. Respect</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Treat colleagues, customers, managers, and business partners with\r\n            professionalism, dignity, and respect.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>3. Collaboration</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Work as a team, share knowledge, support your colleagues, and\r\n            understand that successful results often require collaboration.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>4. Excellence</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Take pride in your work and continuously look for ways to improve\r\n            quality, efficiency, and customer satisfaction.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>5. Accountability</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Take ownership of your responsibilities, commitments, deadlines,\r\n            decisions, and results.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
9	2026-10-22 08:38:42.862777+00	t	4		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Attendance &amp; Punctuality\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Reliable attendance and punctuality are essential to maintaining an\r\n        effective and productive workplace.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Employees Are Expected To:</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Arrive at work according to their assigned schedule.</li>\r\n        <li>Be ready to begin work at the scheduled start time.</li>\r\n        <li>Maintain regular and reliable attendance.</li>\r\n        <li>Follow the organization's attendance procedures.</li>\r\n        <li>Inform their manager or the appropriate HR representative if they\r\n            expect to be late or absent.</li>\r\n        <li>Provide required documentation when applicable.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Unplanned Absence</h2>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        If an unexpected situation prevents you from attending work, notify\r\n        your manager or the designated reporting channel as soon as reasonably\r\n        possible.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="padding: 20px; background: #fff8e1; border-radius: 10px;">\r\n        <strong>Important:</strong> Repeated lateness, unauthorized absences,\r\n        or failure to follow attendance procedures may result in appropriate\r\n        corrective or disciplinary action.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
10	2026-10-22 08:38:42.865828+00	t	5		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Leave &amp; Time Off\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        DSG recognizes that employees may need time away from work for\r\n        personal, family, medical, or other legitimate reasons.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Before Taking Leave</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ol style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Submit your leave request through the designated process.</li>\r\n        <li>Provide sufficient notice whenever possible.</li>\r\n        <li>Ensure your manager is aware of planned leave.</li>\r\n        <li>Complete any required handover before your absence.</li>\r\n        <li>Ensure urgent tasks are appropriately communicated.</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n\r\n    <h2>During Unexpected Situations</h2>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        If you cannot attend work unexpectedly, notify your manager or the\r\n        designated reporting channel as soon as possible.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n        Leave eligibility, approval, limits, and documentation requirements\r\n        are governed by the applicable DSG HR policies and employment terms.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
11	2026-10-22 08:38:42.870128+00	t	6		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Workplace Conduct\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Every DSG employee contributes to the environment in which we work.\r\n        Professional behavior is expected regardless of position, department,\r\n        or seniority.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Expected Behavior</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Communicate respectfully and professionally.</li>\r\n        <li>Listen to different perspectives.</li>\r\n        <li>Resolve disagreements constructively.</li>\r\n        <li>Maintain appropriate workplace boundaries.</li>\r\n        <li>Follow reasonable instructions from authorized management.</li>\r\n        <li>Protect company and customer information.</li>\r\n        <li>Represent DSG professionally when dealing with customers and partners.</li>\r\n        <li>Take responsibility for mistakes and work toward solutions.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Unacceptable Behavior</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Harassment or bullying</li>\r\n        <li>Threatening or intimidating behavior</li>\r\n        <li>Discrimination</li>\r\n        <li>Abusive or offensive communication</li>\r\n        <li>Intentional disruption of the workplace</li>\r\n        <li>Dishonesty or deliberate misconduct</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
12	2026-10-22 08:38:42.873438+00	t	7		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Information Security &amp; Confidentiality\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Information is one of the most valuable assets of any modern\r\n        organization. Employees are responsible for protecting company,\r\n        employee, customer, and business information.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Protect Your Access</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Never share passwords or authentication credentials.</li>\r\n        <li>Use only authorized accounts and systems.</li>\r\n        <li>Lock your workstation when leaving it unattended.</li>\r\n        <li>Do not install unauthorized software or applications.</li>\r\n        <li>Report suspicious emails, links, or security incidents.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Protect Confidential Information</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Do not disclose confidential information to unauthorized people.</li>\r\n        <li>Do not copy or transfer company data without authorization.</li>\r\n        <li>Store business information using approved systems.</li>\r\n        <li>Be careful when sharing documents externally.</li>\r\n        <li>Follow applicable data protection and security procedures.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <p style="padding: 20px; background: #fff8e1; border-radius: 10px;">\r\n        <strong>Think before you share.</strong>\r\n        When in doubt about whether information can be shared, consult your\r\n        manager or the appropriate department.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
13	2026-10-22 08:38:42.876496+00	t	8		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Company Assets &amp; Technology\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        DSG may provide employees with computers, mobile devices, software,\r\n        accounts, internet access, documents, equipment, and other resources\r\n        required to perform their jobs.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Employees Should:</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Use company equipment responsibly.</li>\r\n        <li>Protect devices from unauthorized access.</li>\r\n        <li>Keep company systems and software updated when required.</li>\r\n        <li>Use approved applications and services.</li>\r\n        <li>Report damaged, lost, or compromised equipment promptly.</li>\r\n        <li>Follow IT and information security instructions.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Remember</h2>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Company technology and resources are provided primarily to support\r\n        business activities. Employees should use them responsibly and in\r\n        accordance with applicable company policies.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
14	2026-10-22 08:38:42.879775+00	t	9		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Communication &amp; Professionalism\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Effective communication is essential for teamwork and business\r\n        success. Every interaction should reflect professionalism and respect.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>When Communicating With Colleagues</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Be clear and respectful.</li>\r\n        <li>Respond to important messages in a reasonable timeframe.</li>\r\n        <li>Keep discussions constructive.</li>\r\n        <li>Avoid unnecessary conflict or personal attacks.</li>\r\n        <li>Use appropriate communication channels.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>When Communicating With Clients</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Remain professional and courteous.</li>\r\n        <li>Provide accurate information.</li>\r\n        <li>Do not make commitments outside your authority.</li>\r\n        <li>Escalate issues when necessary.</li>\r\n        <li>Protect client confidentiality.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
15	2026-10-22 08:38:42.882892+00	t	10		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Performance &amp; Accountability\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        At DSG, employees are encouraged to take ownership of their work and\r\n        continuously develop their skills.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Take Ownership</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Understand your goals and responsibilities.</li>\r\n        <li>Complete assigned work within agreed timelines.</li>\r\n        <li>Communicate early when you encounter obstacles.</li>\r\n        <li>Ask for clarification when requirements are unclear.</li>\r\n        <li>Accept constructive feedback.</li>\r\n        <li>Look for opportunities to improve your work.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Continuous Development</h2>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Your growth matters. Take advantage of learning opportunities,\r\n        feedback, mentoring, training, and collaboration with experienced\r\n        colleagues.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
16	2026-10-22 08:38:42.886129+00	t	11		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        A Respectful &amp; Inclusive Workplace\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        DSG is committed to maintaining a professional workplace where\r\n        employees can perform their responsibilities without harassment,\r\n        intimidation, discrimination, or inappropriate behavior.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>We Expect Everyone To:</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Treat colleagues with dignity and respect.</li>\r\n        <li>Respect professional boundaries.</li>\r\n        <li>Avoid offensive or inappropriate comments and behavior.</li>\r\n        <li>Respect differences of opinion.</li>\r\n        <li>Raise concerns through appropriate reporting channels.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Speak Up</h2>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        If you experience or witness behavior that may violate workplace\r\n        standards, report it through the appropriate HR or management channel.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="padding: 20px; background: #f4f7fa; border-radius: 10px;">\r\n        <strong>Everyone has a role in creating a safe, respectful, and\r\n        professional workplace.</strong>\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
17	2026-10-22 08:38:42.889638+00	t	12		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Conflict of Interest\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Employees should make business decisions based on the interests of\r\n        DSG and avoid situations where personal interests could improperly\r\n        influence professional decisions.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Potential Conflicts May Include:</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Personal financial interests involving company decisions.</li>\r\n        <li>Outside activities that interfere with job responsibilities.</li>\r\n        <li>Undisclosed relationships affecting business decisions.</li>\r\n        <li>Using company information for personal benefit.</li>\r\n        <li>Accepting inappropriate benefits from suppliers or customers.</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        If you believe a potential conflict exists, disclose it through the\r\n        appropriate management or HR channel so that it can be evaluated\r\n        appropriately.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
18	2026-10-22 08:38:42.893131+00	t	13		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Disciplinary Process\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Company policies establish standards that employees are expected to\r\n        follow. Where those standards are not met, DSG may take appropriate\r\n        corrective or disciplinary action in accordance with applicable\r\n        policies and requirements.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Possible Corrective Actions</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ol style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2.1;">\r\n        <li>Informal discussion or coaching</li>\r\n        <li>Formal counseling or documented warning</li>\r\n        <li>Performance or corrective action plan</li>\r\n        <li>Further disciplinary action where appropriate</li>\r\n        <li>Termination of employment in serious or applicable cases</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        The appropriate response depends on the circumstances, seriousness,\r\n        frequency, impact, and applicable company policies.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="padding: 20px; background: #fff8e1; border-radius: 10px;">\r\n        <strong>Important:</strong> Serious misconduct may result in\r\n        significant disciplinary action in accordance with applicable\r\n        company policy and law.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
19	2026-10-22 08:38:42.896338+00	t	14		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Examples of Policy Violations\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        The following are examples of conduct that may require corrective or\r\n        disciplinary action, depending on the circumstances:\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Fraud, theft, or deliberate dishonesty</li>\r\n        <li>Unauthorized disclosure of confidential information</li>\r\n        <li>Harassment, bullying, or threatening behavior</li>\r\n        <li>Intentional misuse of company systems or assets</li>\r\n        <li>Repeated unauthorized absence</li>\r\n        <li>Serious insubordination</li>\r\n        <li>Falsification of company records</li>\r\n        <li>Unauthorized access to information or systems</li>\r\n        <li>Deliberate violation of security procedures</li>\r\n        <li>Conduct that seriously damages the company's reputation or operations</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <p style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 16px;">\r\n        These examples are not exhaustive. Employees should always refer to\r\n        the applicable DSG policy for complete requirements.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
20	2026-10-22 08:38:42.899315+00	t	15		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Speak Up &amp; Report Concerns\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;">\r\n        If something doesn't feel right, don't ignore it.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8;">\r\n        Employees are encouraged to raise workplace concerns through the\r\n        appropriate reporting channels. Early communication can help resolve\r\n        issues before they become larger problems.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <h2>You May Raise Concerns About:</h2>\r\n\r\n    <ul style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 2;">\r\n        <li>Workplace misconduct</li>\r\n        <li>Harassment or inappropriate behavior</li>\r\n        <li>Security or data incidents</li>\r\n        <li>Policy violations</li>\r\n        <li>Ethical concerns</li>\r\n        <li>Workplace safety concerns</li>\r\n        <li>Other serious workplace issues</li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n\r\n    <p style="padding: 20px; background: #f4f7fa; border-radius: 10px;">\r\n        <strong>Remember:</strong> If you are unsure whether something should\r\n        be reported, it is generally better to seek guidance from HR or your\r\n        manager.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
21	2026-10-22 08:38:42.902547+00	t	16		<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 35px;">\r\n\r\n    <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 34px;">\r\n        Your Role Matters\r\n    </h1>\r\n\r\n    <p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; text-align: center;">\r\n        Every employee contributes to the success of Data Sphere Global.\r\n    </p>\r\n\r\n    <div style="margin-top: 35px;">\r\n\r\n        <h2>Be Responsible</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Own your responsibilities, commitments, and results.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>Be Curious</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Ask questions, learn new skills, and seek opportunities to improve.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>Be Collaborative</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Support your colleagues and contribute positively to your team.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>Be Professional</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Remember that your actions and communication represent both you\r\n            and DSG.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n        <h2>Keep Improving</h2>\r\n        <p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7;">\r\n            Success comes from continuous learning and a willingness to grow.\r\n        </p>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>		4	1	1
